:"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Wow, Calvin! That's great to hear! Any specific spots in Tokyo that you're really excited to check out?\n[S24T18] (dia_id: D24:18)\n\nCalvin: Yeah definitely! Shibuya Crossing is like Tokyo's Times Square, and I was excited to explore Shinjuku. Plus, there's amazing food there, can't wait to try it again! Look at the photo of Shibuya Crossing at night, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain]\n[S24T19] (dia_id: D24:19)\n\nDave: Shibuya and Shinjuku are cool spots! The food in Tokyo is great, I'll have so much fun exploring all the different places. Have you tried ramen yet? Here's a photo of a ramen bowl that I tried in Boston, it was delicious, but i think in Tokyo it will be even better!\n[Image caption: a photo of a bowl of soup with broccoli and noodles]\n[S24T20] (dia_id: D24:20)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Never tried it, but it's supposed to be awesome. Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\n[S24T21] (dia_id: D24:21)\n\nDave: Do it, Calvin! Once you try it, you'll never go back. Bon voyage and have fun!\n[S24T22] (dia_id: D24:22)","text_sha256":"aa2b521bf29ed6e2ba745cd59324a3890b873287e67f159654a1d9be427fc8c8","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":544,"filesystem_tool_calls":4,"model_calls":5,"orchestration_calls":2,"prompt_tokens":37588,"provider_request_attempts":5,"provider_rounds":5,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":38132},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"62b8b913b4150076b36955c9c8aa8ce9c72e8670988668ff57a4397171d44129","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c971